00:34:19.000 --> 00:34:22.000
Ära midagi rumalat tee.

00:34:56.000 --> 00:34:58.000
Ma ootan.

00:34:58.000 --> 00:35:00.000
Halloo? Ma ootan.

00:35:01.000 --> 00:35:02.000
Halloo?

00:35:10.000 --> 00:35:16.000
Meie andmetel on esimese
